Spelunkery for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.2.0)

A port of Spelunkery 1.20.1-0.3.16 (Fabric) by Ordana and Keybounce, with contributions from Bobisnotaperson,
ElBones, Nerjal Nosk, ChromaPIE and Mikeliro (fabric.mod.json).
Original source: https://github.com/AstralOrdana/Spelunkery
Homepage: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spelunkery
Original licence: LGPL-3.0 ("LGPLv3" in fabric.mod.json; the jar ships no licence file)

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust on Horizon's mod API, and the content (blocks,
items, textures, models, sounds, loot, recipes, tags, worldgen) is carried over from the original jar and converted
to 26.3's formats. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (LGPL-3.0); the licence text is in
LICENSE, and COPYING is the GNU GPL v3 text the LGPL builds on. Built against Horizon's exact-build SDK
dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

